# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# .gitignore
# GHA-LoC-Badge
#
# Author:     CodeAnthem
# Created:    2026-09-28
# Modified:   2026-09-28
# Version:    v1.0.0
#
# Taken from gitignore_template. Enabled rules are the shared defaults.
# A pattern you can turn on uses one hash. Notes use two hashes, so they stay comments.
# dist/ stays tracked. GitHub runs dist/index.js.
# Negation rules in Keep stay last so they win.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Project Specific
# Generated badges. The published image is pushed to the images branch.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.svg

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local scratch
# Per-repo working notes that are not shipped.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# .wip/

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Leak Protection
# Keys, secrets, identity material, and local-only config. Enabled for every repository.
# Example env files and public keys are restored in Keep.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
secrets/
*.age
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.ppk
*.jks
*.keystore
keys.txt
**/age-key.txt
id_dsa
id_ecdsa
id_ecdsa_sk
id_ed25519
id_ed25519_sk
id_rsa

credentials.json
secrets.json
service-account.json

.env
.env.*
config.local.*
*.local.json
*.local.yaml
*.local.yml

*.secret
*.secrets
*.secret.json
*.secret.yaml
*.secret.yml

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Temp Files
# Scratch, backups, and caches that should not be tracked.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.tmp/
tmp/
temp/
.cache/

*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
*.lock~
*.un~
*.pid
*.pid.lock

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Logs
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
logs/
log/
nohup.out

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Operating System
# macOS, Windows, and Linux filesystem junk.
# Installers such as *.msi and *.cab are in Archives and binaries.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*
.localized
__MACOSX/
.DocumentRevisions-V100
.fseventsd
.Spotlight-V100
.TemporaryItems
.Trashes
.VolumeIcon.icns
.com.apple.timemachine.donotpresent
.apdisk
.AppleDB
.AppleDesktop
lost+found

Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
ehthumbs.db
ehthumbs_vista.db
[Dd]esktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.stackdump
*.lnk

.fuse_hidden*
.directory
.Trash-*
.nfs*

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors
# Swap, backup, and session files are enabled.
# IDE project directories stay commented so a team can still commit shared settings.
# Broad Vim swap globs are omitted because they also match SVG files.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.swp
*.swo
*.swn
*~
.#*
\#*\#
.netrwhist
Session.vim
Sessionx.vim

## Vim tag file. Uncomment when this repo has no tracked file or directory named tags.
# tags

## Emacs build state.
# *.elc
# auto-save-list
# *_flymake.*
# flycheck_*.el
# *.~undo-tree~
# .dir-locals.el

## JetBrains
.idea/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.fleet/

## VS Code
# .vscode/
# *.code-workspace

## Visual Studio
# .vs/
# *.user
# *.userosscache
# *.suo

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Languages
# Optional. Uncomment the block that matches this repository.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
## --- Node.js ---
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*
.npm/
.yarn/cache/
.yarn/unplugged/
.pnpm-store/
.bun/
.parcel-cache/
.eslintcache
.stylelintcache
.cache-loader/

## --- Python ---
## Uncomment build/ and dist/ under Build when this repo is packaged.
## env/ and ENV/ match every directory of that name. Remove them if a source directory is named env.
# __pycache__/
# *.py[cod]
# *$py.class
# .pytest_cache/
# .mypy_cache/
# .ruff_cache/
# .pyre/
# .tox/
# .nox/
# .coverage
# .coverage.*
# htmlcov/
# .venv/
# venv/
# env/
# ENV/
# *.egg-info/
# .eggs/
# .ipynb_checkpoints/

## --- Java / JVM ---
## Uncomment target/ under Build.
## *.jar ignores every jar. Remove that line if this repo tracks third-party jars.
# .gradle/
# .gradle-cache/
# *.class
# *.jar
# *.war
# *.ear

## --- Rust ---
## Uncomment target/ under Build.
## Uncomment the next line for a library. An application keeps Cargo.lock tracked.
# Cargo.lock

## --- Go ---
## Uncomment bin/ under Build.
# *.test
# *.out

## --- .NET / C# ---
## Uncomment bin/ and obj/ under Build.
## Visual Studio files are under Editors.
# *.nupkg
# packages/

## --- PHP / Composer ---
## vendor/ ignores every directory of that name, including a Go vendor directory.
# vendor/
# composer.phar

## --- Ruby ---
## tmp/, log/, and coverage/ are already covered above and under Test / coverage.
# .bundle/
# vendor/bundle/
# *.gem

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build / generated output
# Uncomment the lines this repository generates.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
## dist/ stays tracked. GitHub runs dist/index.js.
# dist/
# build/
# out/
# bin/
# obj/
# target/
# .next/
# .nuxt/
# .svelte-kit/
# .vercel/
# .netlify/
# .turbo/
# storybook-static/
# *.generated.*
# *.gen.*
# site/
# .public/

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Test / coverage
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# coverage/
# .nyc_output/
# test-results/
# playwright-report/
# blob-report/
# junit.xml
# TestResults/

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local tooling
# Version managers and directory-local environments.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# .direnv/
# .nvmrc.local
# .tool-versions.local
# .mise/

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Infrastructure
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
## --- Nix ---
# result
# result-*

## --- Terraform ---
## *.log already ignores crash.log.
# .terraform/
# *.tfstate
# *.tfstate.*
# *.tfvars
# *.tfvars.json
# !*.tfvars.example

## --- Docker ---
# docker-compose.override.yml
# docker-compose.local.yml

## --- Cloud local state ---
# .serverless/
# .aws-sam/
# .sam/
# .chalice/

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Databases
# Local development data.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# *.sqlite
# *.sqlite3
# *.db
# *.db-shm
# *.db-wal

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Archives and binaries
# Uncomment when this repository should not track downloaded or generated packages.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# *.zip
# *.tar
# *.tar.gz
# *.tgz
# *.7z
# *.rar
# *.dmg
# *.iso
# *.exe
# *.msi
# *.cab
# *.msix
# *.msm
# *.msp
# *.deb
# *.rpm

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Media
# Uncomment when this repository should not track these files.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# *.mp4
# *.mov
# *.avi
# *.mkv
# *.psd
# *.ai
# *.wav
# *.flac

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Keep
# Templates and public keys. This section stays last so these rules win.
# A file inside an ignored directory stays ignored. To track an example under secrets/,
# remove the secrets/ rule and ignore the secret files themselves.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
!.gitkeep
!*.pub
!.env.example
!.env.sample
!.env.template
!*.example
